# Code owners
#
# STATUS: INACTIVE. Every rule below is commented out on purpose.
#
# An active CODEOWNERS rule that names a team which does not exist (or that
# lacks repository access) silently blocks every pull request touching the
# matched path: GitHub cannot request the required review, so the merge button
# never unlocks. Keep these rules commented until the teams exist.
#
# TO ACTIVATE
#   1. Create the teams in the GitHub organisation and grant them repository
#      access.
#   2. Replace each @ORG/... placeholder with the real team or user handle.
#   3. Uncomment the rules you want enforced.
#   4. Mirror the same owners in docs/OWNERSHIP.md through the same PR.
#   5. Verify with docs/GITHUB_SETUP.md section 7: open one harmless PR per
#      owned path and confirm the expected reviewer is auto-requested.
#
# During Hackathon Mode (RULES.md section 10) this file is expected to stay
# inactive. Reinstating it is part of exiting the exception.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner for anything not matched below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# *                     @ORG/governance

